    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synopsis:</strong></h2>You are awakened by your wife and find yourself in a dark and ominous dungeon cell, only dimly lit by torches. Upon opening your eyes, you see her lips are stitched together and quickly realize yours have been stitched as well. To your left, the door to your cell is wide open, allowing you to escape. <br>Whatever hell you have woke up in, you're able to uncover its horrors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Info:</strong></h2><strong>Dismantled 2</strong> is a survival horror game. <br>It will see new characters involved in the story, four years after the events of the first game.<br>It is inspired by old <strong>Resident evil</strong> and <strong>Silent hill </strong>games, <strong>The Suffering</strong> games and by old B-movies.<br><strong>Dismantled 2</strong> aims for an N64 style aesthetic, but will also features more modern options settings.  <br>The game will be as gory and disturbing as the first game, if not more... and for that, will also have a censored version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2>Inventory management is the key to survival.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/ce0168bdcb09f443910cd540a95cb320.poster.avif?t=1709030094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/ce0168bdcb09f443910cd540a95cb320.webm?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/ce0168bdcb09f443910cd540a95cb320.mp4?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Solve puzzles by examining objects.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/c65225e301377ede40b8b4704785ddb4.poster.avif?t=1709030094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/c65225e301377ede40b8b4704785ddb4.webm?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/c65225e301377ede40b8b4704785ddb4.mp4?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Fight against all kinds of abominations.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/dd4054b4148516f99af8dec86b878a0d.poster.avif?t=1709030094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/dd4054b4148516f99af8dec86b878a0d.webm?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/dd4054b4148516f99af8dec86b878a0d.mp4?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Aim for the heads!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/92faf2e935fd84372992a241f4fa2818.poster.avif?t=1709030094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/92faf2e935fd84372992a241f4fa2818.webm?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/92faf2e935fd84372992a241f4fa2818.mp4?t=1709030094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Put them to pieces...</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563880/extras/cb0fb572e157ddc6a2da4dd0bdba1c3b.poster.avif?t=1709030094\" ><sour